# The working copies here are LF and the build runs on Linux (Vercel, Cloudflare),
# so store LF in the repo and let Windows checkouts do what they like locally.
# Without this, `core.autocrlf=true` on Windows rewrites every file on checkout and
# the next `git status` is a wall of phantom changes.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Assets git must never touch. SVGs are text and stay text — they are edited by hand
# (viewBox fixes live in BRAND-CONSENT.md) and should diff line by line.
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
